  "title": "iAltA Launches Quorim to Power Next-Generation Infrastructure for Private Credit",
  "summary": "iAltA, a private markets infrastructure company, today announced the launch of Quorim, a new company designed to modernize infrastructure across private credit markets. Established through a strategic partnership with Tradeweb, a leading global operator of electronic marketplaces, Quorim combines deep private markets expertise with proven experience operating large-scale financial market networks.",
